<title>CHINA: North Korean delegation arrives in Beijing.</title>
<headline>North Korean delegation arrives in Beijing.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A North Korean delegation arrived in Beijing on Saturday, but it was unclear if the group planned to discuss the apparent defection of a senior North Korean official inside the South Korean embassy in Beijing.  </p>
<p>The identities of the North Koreans were not known. The embassy declined to comment.</p>
<p>A Reuters reporter at Beijing international airport witnessed the delegation arrive and board a vehicle belonging to the North Korean embassy.</p>
</text>
